{"date":"2026-11-28T03:41:05Z","photos":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/%E8%B2%B4%E7%B8%A3%E5%A4%A7%E5%8D%97%E9%96%80%E5%9F%8E%E6%A8%93.jpg/960px-%E8%B2%B4%E7%B8%A3%E5%A4%A7%E5%8D%97%E9%96%80%E5%9F%8E%E6%A8%93.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%B2%B4%E7%B8%A3%E5%A4%A7%E5%8D%97%E9%96%80%E5%9F%8E%E6%A8%93.jpg","a":"滕謄","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"​大南門城樓，是廣西壯族自治區貴港市港北區一處市級文物保護單位。城樓位於廣西壯族自治區貴港市港北區鬱江北岸原貴縣人民政府門前48.4米，始建於唐代，後世數次重建，是原貴縣城牆唯一僅剩的城樓，上方原有的門樓已被拆除，今在城門基礎上新建了一座仿古門樓。"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/%E8%B2%B4%E6%B8%AF%E5%B8%82%E6%BC%AA%E7%80%BE%E5%A1%94.jpg/960px-%E8%B2%B4%E6%B8%AF%E5%B8%82%E6%BC%AA%E7%80%BE%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%B2%B4%E6%B8%AF%E5%B8%82%E6%BC%AA%E7%80%BE%E5%A1%94.jpg","a":"滕謄","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"​漪瀾塔，又名安瀾塔，是位於貴港市港南區羅泊灣的一處自治區級文物保護單位。該塔建於清嘉慶二十三年（1818年），爲八角九層樓閣式磚塔。"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Junction_of_Chungshan_Rd._and_Hecheng_Rd._in_Guigang%2C_Guangxi.jpg/960px-Junction_of_Chungshan_Rd._and_Hecheng_Rd._in_Guigang%2C_Guangxi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Junction_of_Chungshan_Rd._and_Hecheng_Rd._in_Guigang,_Guangxi.jpg","a":"Sanmosa","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"​中華人民共和國廣西壯族自治區貴港市中山路與荷城路路口，其中可見電單車（機車／摩托車）與電動車有不同於其他車種的專用直行、左轉行車綫（車道）。"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/%E8%B2%B4%E6%B8%AF%E5%B8%82%E8%AA%A5%E5%91%BD%E7%89%8C%E5%9D%8A.jpg/960px-%E8%B2%B4%E6%B8%AF%E5%B8%82%E8%AA%A5%E5%91%BD%E7%89%8C%E5%9D%8A.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%B2%B4%E6%B8%AF%E5%B8%82%E8%AA%A5%E5%91%BD%E7%89%8C%E5%9D%8A.jpg","a":"滕謄","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"​誥命牌坊，是位於貴港市港北區貴城鎮永明街的一處市級文物保護單位。"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E5%BB%A3%E8%A5%BF%E7%9C%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E5%A4%A7%E6%9C%83%E8%88%8A%E5%9D%80.jpg/960px-%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E5%BB%A3%E8%A5%BF%E7%9C%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E5%A4%A7%E6%9C%83%E8%88%8A%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E5%BB%A3%E8%A5%BF%E7%9C%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E5%A4%A7%E6%9C%83%E8%88%8A%E5%9D%80.jpg","a":"滕謄","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"​中共廣西省第一次代表大會舊址，是廣西壯族自治區貴港市港北區的一處全國重點文物保護單位。舊址位於貴港市港北區貴城街道榕興街（現達開路）36號，是一座磚木結構三進一開間的二層舖房。1928年6月16日，中共廣西省第一次代表大會在此處祕密召开。"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/HK_%E9%AB%98%E9%80%9F%E5%8B%95%E8%BB%8A_High_speed_rail_train_from_HK_%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF_%E4%B9%9D%E9%BE%8D%E7%AB%99_Kln_Station_to_%E5%8D%97%E5%AF%A7%E5%B8%82_Nanning_September_2023_R12S_137.jpg/960px-HK_%E9%AB%98%E9%80%9F%E5%8B%95%E8%BB%8A_High_speed_rail_train_from_HK_%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF_%E4%B9%9D%E9%BE%8D%E7%AB%99_Kln_Station_to_%E5%8D%97%E5%AF%A7%E5%B8%82_Nanning_September_2023_R12S_137.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:HK_%E9%AB%98%E9%80%9F%E5%8B%95%E8%BB%8A_High_speed_rail_train_from_HK_%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF_%E4%B9%9D%E9%BE%8D%E7%AB%99_Kln_Station_to_%E5%8D%97%E5%AF%A7%E5%B8%82_Nanning_September_2023_R12S_137.jpg","a":"Limsn Shusia Ysmarpoo","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"HK 高速動車 High speed rail train from HK 香港 九龍站 Kln Station to 南寧市 Nanning in September 2023"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/HK_%E9%AB%98%E9%80%9F%E5%8B%95%E8%BB%8A_High_speed_rail_train_from_HK_%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF_%E4%B9%9D%E9%BE%8D%E7%AB%99_Kln_Station_to_%E5%8D%97%E5%AF%A7%E5%B8%82_Nanning_September_2023_R12S_135.jpg/960px-